WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.636
-Here at "Late Night" every
night, I deliver a monologue

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.738
comprised of jokes written
by a diverse team of writers.

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:07.574
As a result, a lot of jokes
come across my desk

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:09.209
that due to my being
a straight white male

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:10.877
would be difficult
for me to deliver,

00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:13.146
but we don't think that should
stop you from enjoying them.

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:15.514
So we'd like to share them
with you now in a segment called

00:00:15.514 --> 00:00:17.417
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:20.753
♪♪

00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:22.689
Hey, everybody,
these are two of our writers.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:24.991
That's Amber right there,
and that's Jenny.

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:27.027
-I'm black!
-And I'm gay!

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:29.161
-And we're both women!
-And I'm not.

00:00:29.161 --> 00:00:32.364
So, how this works is I will
read the setups for these jokes,

00:00:32.364 --> 00:00:34.267
and Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:38.071
Here we go. A recent study shows
that computer algorithms

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.506
are more likely to mix up
black women's faces

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:42.308
than those of white women.

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:46.045
-But surely, it would
recognize me, Michelle Obama.

00:00:46.045 --> 00:00:48.114
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.383
-You are not Michelle Obama.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:54.286
-You're right.
I'm Serena Williams.

00:00:54.286 --> 00:00:57.824
-U.S. Women's soccer star
Megan Rapinoe announced today

00:00:57.824 --> 00:00:59.725
that she will be
writing a memoir.

00:00:59.725 --> 00:01:03.162
-Said lesbians,
"Will there be pictures?"

00:01:03.162 --> 00:01:05.731
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.731 --> 00:01:07.933
-Focus Features
has released a trailer

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:10.770
for the new movie "Harriet"
about Harriet Tubman.

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:13.539
-It tells the unlikely story
of a black lady

00:01:13.539 --> 00:01:16.943
who, against all odds, was
the main character in a movie.

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:18.611
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:21.614
-Hey, uh, Amber.

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:23.716
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:26.486
Amber, who's, uh --
Who's playing Harriet Tubman?

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:28.988
-Me, Angela Bassett.
-Okay.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:31.357
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:34.093
Mayor Pete Buttigieg
said recently that he is

00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:37.696
almost certain that America
has already had gay presidents.

00:01:37.696 --> 00:01:39.498
-I mean, you guys,
Abraham Lincoln

00:01:39.498 --> 00:01:43.403
died at the theater.

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:45.404
-How are you so sure
Lincoln was gay?

00:01:45.404 --> 00:01:48.308
-Because he had a beard.
Her name was Mary Todd.

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:50.843
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.843 --> 00:01:53.279
-A British woman
allegedly stabbed her boyfriend

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:55.248
after he tried to stop her

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:57.516
from packing so many clothes
for a vacation.

00:01:57.516 --> 00:02:01.588
-Said the boyfriend,
"Ugh! That was my only shirt."

00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:04.624
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.059 --> 00:02:10.696
-Now you're going to blame
that one on Angela Bassett.

00:02:10.696 --> 00:02:12.665
"That wasn't me!"

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:14.934
A Conservative group
is calling for the boycott

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:17.370
of the movie "Toy Story 4"
because in the background

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.739
of one scene,
there are two lesbian moms.

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:21.941
-A lesbian mom
is like a straight mom

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:24.143
except she's ALWAYS
had that haircut.

00:02:24.143 --> 00:02:26.279
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:28.881
-Wait. Which haircut?
-That haircut.

00:02:28.881 --> 00:02:30.783
-[ Laughs ] All right.

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:33.352
10 police recruits
in Philadelphia were recently

00:02:33.352 --> 00:02:36.355
caught trying to cheat
on an open-book exam.

00:02:36.355 --> 00:02:39.492
-Said one officer, "Psst!
What'd you put down for

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:41.827
'Can you shoot
innocent black people?'"

00:02:41.827 --> 00:02:44.397
[ Audience groans ]

00:02:44.397 --> 00:02:47.333
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:50.169
-Hey, Seth,
why don't you tell one?

00:02:50.169 --> 00:02:53.373
-Oh, yeah, why not? After
Amber warmed them up for me.

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:55.741
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.741 --> 00:02:57.343
-Come on! Just do it!

00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:59.778
-No, I feel like if I tell one,
it will not end well.

00:02:59.778 --> 00:03:01.347
-Just one!

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:04.817
-Ohh, okay.

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:08.187
A couple in Michigan was charged
after animal-control officers

00:03:08.187 --> 00:03:10.957
removed 178 cats
from their home.

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:13.059
178 cats?

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:15.627
Even lesbians think
that's too much pussy.

00:03:15.627 --> 00:03:18.831
-[ Gasps ]
-How dare you!

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:20.633
-You told me it would be okay!

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:22.534
-You should be ashamed
of yourself!

00:03:22.534 --> 00:03:25.138
-I am not! I'm proud of myself!

00:03:25.138 --> 00:03:26.739
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.739 --> 00:03:29.609
♪♪

00:03:29.609 --> 00:03:32.078
Give it up for these two,
everybody. We'll be right back.

